# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按下方规则转换，避免 Windows/Linux 混用导致 diff 全文件变更
* text=auto eol=lf

# 文本文件显式声明
*.md      text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.toml    text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF，否则 cmd 可能无法执行
*.bat     text eol=crlf
*.cmd     text eol=crlf
*.ps1     text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止文本转换与 diff，防止被当作文本比较而产生乱码 diff
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.webp    binary
*.ico     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.zip     binary
*.tar     binary
*.gz      binary
*.tgz     binary
*.7z      binary
*.rar     binary
*.docx    binary
*.xlsx    binary
*.pptx    binary
